  "releaseNotes": "'## [9.11.3](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v9.11.2...v9.11.3) (2025-09-09)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update spectre-console monorepo to 0.51.1 ([#948](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/948)) ([01ac7ad](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/01ac7ad1149d7698167556aec4fd35973caf68ef))\n* **deps:** update actions/setup-dotnet action to v5 ([#946](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/946)) ([97af960](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/97af96006b9f7fdc826e8e2f933b55a94c78484d))\n* **deps:** update actions/setup-node action to v5 ([#947](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/947)) ([89b10fb](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/89b10fbbf2b9b3b9a5e35a9b14d7425a2aa90ec1))\n* **deps:** update actions/upload-pages-artifact action to v4 ([#942](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/942)) ([340482f](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/340482f4809a42f64d3ea8202b1eec2fb456c97e))\n* **deps:** update dependency nuget-license to 3.1.7 ([#941](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/941)) ([d9da730](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/d9da73026f5acf7a65328346e25e3e0232513cc6))\n* **docs:** update dependency @mdx-js/react to v3.1.1 ([#945](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/945)) ([1dbb1f1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/1dbb1f1b70ab15f1c3540fe353b09d7226752a2d))\n* **test:** update dependency kubernetesclient to 17.0.14 ([#944](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/944)) ([72f143b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/72f143b14a1b223815c28ec57f67b1759588d530))\n\n### Documentation\n\n* fix wrong `dotnet kubeops version` command ([#940](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/940)) ([7bbf14b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/7bbf14bc47a34864fbf3b4eb32fd2ad94b3fc6b1))\n'",
